OL,3,GNEWSAHospital extension scrapped as
OL,4,Acosts spiral
OL,5,
OL,6,FA project to extend a hospital has been
OL,7,Fscrapped after costs more than doubled
OL,8,Fto #273m.
OL,10,FThe budget initially approved by the
OL,11,FStates of Guernsey for the project,
OL,12,Fwhich included new operating theatres
OL,13,Fand maternity facilities, was #120m.
OL,15,FThe Committee for Health and Social
OL,16,FCare (HSC) also announced it would
OL,17,Fscrap the second phase of a project to
OL,18,Fdigitise patient records, while a
OL,19,Fdelay-stricken scheme to build a new
OL,20,Fcritical care unit now looks like it
OL,21,Fcould cost about #40m, after a budget
OL,22,Fof #34m was agreed by the States.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
