OL,3,GNEWSAHospital extension scrapped as
OL,4,Acosts spiral
OL,5,
OL,6,FHSC President George Oswald said the
OL,7,Fincrease in costs meant the hospital
OL,8,Fextension was now "unaffordable" and
OL,9,F"cannot realistically be delivered".
